+// errThrottled is the answer of a Kubernetes API that throttles dex: API Priority
+// and Fairness rejects the request with 429 when its queue is full.
+var errThrottled = errors.New(`GET https://10.222.0.1:443/apis/dex.coreos.com/v1/namespaces/d8-user-authn/passwords/x: Too Many Requests: response from server "Too many requests, please try again later."`)
